  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two containers are filled with monatomic gas of equal mass at the same temperature. One container holds helium and the other neon.</p>\n<p>The mass of a neon atom is five times the mass of a helium atom.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{internal energy of the helium gas}}{\\textit{internal energy of the neon gas}}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{5}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{5}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
